00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Five mistakes tourists make in China — none are cultural.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,200
I'm your China Travel Expert.

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,800
One: you land, and your card just won't work.

4
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,400
Two: Google, WhatsApp, Instagram — all blocked.

5
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:12,000
Three: big cities have four or five train stations.

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,600
