7
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:17,200
Double-tap if number two would've caught you.

8
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,800
Five: flying everywhere — the train shows the real China.

9
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:23,400
★ Expert Tip: Set up Alipay or WeChat Pay before you fly.

